# macOS / SMB share artifacts
# The NAS is mounted over SMB, which renames deleted files to .smbdelete*
# instead of removing them. They're invisible in Finder but git will happily
# commit ~28MB of them if you let it.
.smbdelete*
._*
.DS_Store
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.TemporaryItems
.fseventsd

# Local working files — not part of the site.
#
# The deploy rule has always been "nothing starting with _ goes on the server",
# but this listed the underscore files by hand, so every new one had to be
# remembered. It is a wildcard now. The two below don't start with _ and so
# still need naming: CNAME.txt is a stray twin of the real CNAME (no extension,
# and it MUST keep shipping), and CHANGELOG_RUNNING.md is a scratch log.
_*
CHANGELOG_RUNNING.md
CNAME.txt
SITEhandoff.md
node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SOURCE MEDIA — WHITELIST, NOT BLACKLIST
#
# This used to list folders by name in CAPS (IMAGES/lookoutbts/ and friends)
# because that's how the SMB mount displays them. The folders on disk are
# lowercase and git is case-sensitive, so not one of those rules matched —
# 868 MB of HEIC originals and untouched camera MOVs sat unprotected.
# images/lookoutbts alone holds a 504 MB clip, and GitHub hard-rejects any
# single file over 100 MB.
#
# Naming folders by hand is what failed, so this ignores everything under
# images/ and re-admits only the seven the site actually references. Any new
# source folder is now ignored by default — the safe direction to be wrong in.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
images/*/
!images/brass/
!images/itsaboy/
!images/lejuice/
!images/lookout/
!images/moz/
!images/scattered/
!images/traildead/
!images/og/

# Camera formats, wherever they land. 26 HEIC originals (66 MB) were found
# sitting inside images/itsaboy/ — a whitelisted folder, so the rules above
# would have waved them straight through. Only Safari renders HEIC; Chrome
# and Firefox show a broken image. Convert to JPEG, then ship the JPEG.
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.mov
*.MOV
*.dng
*.DNG
*.arw
*.ARW
*.braw
*.BRAW
